        "Title": "Hitman 1. Episode 3. The last crew.",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK_ZIKA",
        "PublicId": "116392933820",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Bangkok/scene_zika.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6bed9b64-cb24-412f-bcee-f4d36bf8ca15).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. I didn&apos;t want to bother you anymore tonight, but this is important. You see, Jordan Cross&apos;s song would have been released in a few weeks if you hadn&apos;t murdered him. But I just found out that his voice part was done, so technically he wouldn&apos;t be needed anymore. Which means you have to murder the last people who have recordings of Jordan Cross&apos; vocals, which are Kurth Hondo, Taylor Todd, and Altmuligman Rogan. Tomorrow you will leave Bankok, and travel to Sapienza. Have fun!",
